# | Advantech ADAM-6052 — 8DI / 8DO Digital I/O Module with Counter/Pulse (Ethernet/Modbus TCP)
# | 
# | Source: advantech-adam-6000-modbus.pdf (Appendix B.2)
# | - 8 digital inputs (DI) + 8 digital outputs (DO); each DI configurable as counter/frequency.
# | - Modbus TCP (Ethernet), unit identifier = 1.
# | - FC02 addr 0-7 (00001-00008): DI value ch 0-7 (R).
# | - FC01 addr 16-23 (00017-00024): DO value ch 0-7 (R/W).
# | - FC01 counter coils per DI ch (4 coils each):
# | ch 0: addr 32-35 (start/stop, clear, clear-overflow, latch); ... ch 7: addr 60-63.
# | - FC01 addr 300-307 (00301-00308): Clear GCL internal counter ch 0-7 (Write).
# | - FC03 addr 0-15: Counter/Frequency ch 0-7 (u32, 2 regs each; Freq = value/10 Hz) (R).
# | - FC03 addr 16-31: Pulse output low-level width ch 0-7 (u32, unit 0.1ms) (R/W).
# | - FC03 addr 32-47: Pulse output high-level width ch 0-7 (u32) (R/W).
# | - FC03 addr 48-63: Set absolute pulse count ch 0-7 (u32; 0=continuous mode) (R/W).
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Advantech
@model=ADAM-6052
@vendor_website=advantech.com
@description=8DI + 8DO digital I/O with counter/frequency and pulse output over Modbus TCP. DI at FC02 coil addr 0-7; DO at FC01 coil addr 16-23. FC03 addr 0-15: counter/freq u32 (8ch). FC03 addr 300: DI word; addr 302: DO word.
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/advantech-adam-6052-dio.toml; Source: advantech-adam-6000-modbus.pdf (Appendix B.2). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
